  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PATH &amp; OncoInv &#x2013; oncology platform development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IA financial contribution supports a feasibility and market validation study for the introduction of OncoSeek&#xae;, a blood-based early cancer detection tool, in India. The project assesses technical feasibility and acceptance among clinicians and healthcare providers across different settings.



Once implemented, the solution is expected to improve early cancer detection, enabling more timely treatment and better health outcomes, while increasing access to affordable diagnostics. The study will provide a clear view on adoption, regulatory alignment, and the viability of scaling the technology in the Indian healthcare system.</narrative>
  </description>
